<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index fell to 1,382.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index fell to 1,382.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Jan 28 Reuter - The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates fell to 1,382 today from 1,394 on Jan 27, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
